build/
.vscode/
narval_program
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.o
*.md
!README.md

# Loose .nv scratch files stay local. tests/ is NOT ignored: it is part of the
# build (ctest narval_integration runs tests/integration/run.py), so the harness,
# its fixtures and the manual probes are versioned.
*.nv
!stdlib/**/*.nv
!tests/**/*.nv
